Fiction Disclaimer / 虚构作品声明:
This repository ("Theologia Caerulea · 蓝色神学档案馆") is a work of fiction.
All fictional sites, containment zones, anomalies, and organizations depicted on
real-world maps have no affiliation with any real-world institution, school,
hospital, government agency, or private residence.

